# Copy to `.env` (or `.env.local`) for `npm run dev` / `npm run build`.
# Must match the backend's PORTAL_TOKEN (see repo root .env.example) — the
# portal sends this as the X-Portal-Token header on every request
# (DESIGN §Portal API). Vite only exposes env vars prefixed VITE_ to
# client code, and this is never hardcoded in source (see src/api.ts).
VITE_PORTAL_TOKEN=dev-portal-token
